  {
    "id": 9,
    "name": "Joey Webster",
    "url": "https://peptidescostarica.net/",
    "description": "Joey Webster is the President and Co-Founder of Peptides Costa Rica, a company dedicated to providing high-quality research peptides with a focus on transparency, education, and exceptional customer service. Drawing on years of experience in high-performance athletics and business, Joey has helped build one of Costa Rica's leading local peptide companies by emphasizing reliable access, clear communication, and responsible product information.\r\n\r\nBefore founding Peptides Costa Rica, Joey competed in wrestling at the California State Wrestling Championships, where he set the record for the fastest pin in the tournament. After relocating to Costa Rica more than 15 years ago, he immersed himself in boxing, Muay Thai, and mixed martial arts. His personal experience overcoming multiple serious injuries reinforced his passion for recovery, performance optimization, and the science behind peptides.\r\n\r\nToday, Joey oversees the company's operations, educational content, and customer experience, helping ensure that every customer has access to accurate information and dependable service. His mission is to make Peptides Costa Rica the country's most trusted source for research peptides by combining real-world athletic experience with a commitment to quality, transparency, and continuous learning.",
